 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 01:36:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-build-a-dna-computer-that-can-perform-calculations-in-a-drop-of-water</guid></item><item><title>斯坦福大学医学院主导的研究发现，人脑是两个独立的器官</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-brain-is-two-separate-organs-stanford-medicine-led-research-finds</link><description>“斯坦福大学医学院领导的一项新研究发现，大脑是两个彼此相邻的独立器官。这一发现可能有助于研究毁灭性的神经系统疾病。” &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/human-brain-is-two-separate-organs-stanford-medicine-led-research-finds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 01:21:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-brain-is-two-separate-organs-stanford-medicine-led-research-finds</guid></item><item><title>干细胞诺贝尔奖颁给ER 100：我们真的能逆转衰老吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stem-cell-nobel-prize-to-er-100-can-we-really-reverse-aging</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 01:06:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stem-cell-nobel-prize-to-er-100-can-we-really-reverse-aging</guid></item><item><title>ScientistTwo：利用自主人工智能开拓人类知识前沿</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientisttwo-pioneering-the-human-knowledge-frontier-with-autonomous-ai</link><description>在 107 个研究问题中的 86 个上击败了人类 SOTA（平均增益增加 25.2%），论文得分超过了已接受的 ICLR 2026 和 NeurIPS 2025 提交的论文。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientisttwo-pioneering-the-human-knowledge-frontier-with-autonomous-ai2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:51:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientisttwo-pioneering-the-human-knowledge-frontier-with-autonomous-ai</guid></item><item><title>欧洲核子研究中心和学习</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cern-and-learn</link><description>&lt;img src="https://poli